Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Persian (Jalali) calendar in the terminal
 jala is a command-line tool that prints the Persian (Jalali)
 calendar in the terminal. It supports single-month, three-month,
 and full-year layouts, Persian digits and names, day-of-year,
 the Imperial year, English weekday names, date conversion between
 Jalali and Gregorian calendars, and date differences.
 .
 It is inspired by jcal and jdate and adds conversion and diff
 subcommands.
